    <p>
        I am a computer engineering student at UC San Diego with an interest in building practical
        systems across robotics, AI and automation, and web software. Nixon FM is a way to present my
        work like a music library so you can browse projects as tracks, playlists, and technical
        case studies.
    </p>

    <p>
        My goal is to explain my projects clearly without skipping the technical details.
        Each project page shows the motivation, my contribution, the tools used,
        constraints, outcomes, and lessons learned.
    </p>
